      <h2 class="disp">A pandemic that touched almost everywhere at once.</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="flu-sub">Unlike a slow-building outbreak, the fall 1918 wave circled the globe in months, riding troop ships and rail lines built for a war. Circles are scaled to estimated deaths; the deadliest tolls, by percentage of population, were often in places furthest from any hospital.</p>
